{"id":"f3805b48-c9ff-4cbf-abe4-9838b9981714","body":"Upstream follow-up for this dependency upgrade

- [Drizzle #6730](https://github.com/drizzle-team/drizzle-orm/issues/6730) reproduces rc.6 interpreting a backslash-escaped `NULL` array element as SQL null. The affected text parser exists in the published package. Evorto's current `varchar[]` role IDs use the native `@effect/sql-pg` codecs, and the reference snapshot will track upstream.
